    "detailed_description": "Descend into the depths of Last Rebirth, a horde survival game. Choose from a diverse array of heroes and engage in battles against eerie adversaries from beyond. <br><br>Survive wave after wave until facing one of the lords of sins. Enhance your hero with character traits, abilities, and items, crafting a powerful new build in each run. Delve into various dungeons, discovering potent items that empower you to venture even deeper into the abyss.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/fc537bcb8358a6412e449a22a784b336.poster.avif?t=1725670888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/fc537bcb8358a6412e449a22a784b336.webm?t=1725670888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/fc537bcb8358a6412e449a22a784b336.mp4?t=1725670888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/f143e9ef44abf61b77c5fdf09ac6790b.avif?t=1725670888\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Embark on your journey as one of the last surviving mortals, each with distinct skills and builds.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/753ce6c03b99a1ea6b96efc521dfecfa.poster.avif?t=1725670888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/753ce6c03b99a1ea6b96efc521dfecfa.webm?t=1725670888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hunt for epic glyphs and upgrade your gear through synthesis. By combining glyphs with your equipment, you unlock new abilities, enhance stats, and customize your gear to match your personal combat style.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/156fedbabb26de169a80a4bb091e4e20.poster.avif?t=1725670888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/156fedbabb26de169a80a4bb091e4e20.webm?t=1725670888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/156fedbabb26de169a80a4bb091e4e20.mp4?t=1725670888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hunt for runes and enhance your abilities by engraving them.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/6a0994ebdbac7076c0580f525671b729.poster.avif?t=1725670888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/6a0994ebdbac7076c0580f525671b729.webm?t=1725670888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540940/extras/6a0994ebdbac7076c0580f525671b729.mp4?t=1725670888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
